# EmailJS Configuration
# Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com/ (free tier: 200 emails/month)
#
# Steps to configure:
# 1. Create an EmailJS account
# 2. Add an Email Service (Gmail recommended) -> copy the Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with these variables:
#    - {{firstName}}, {{lastName}}, {{email}}, {{message}}
#    Set "To Email" to: gurramindra.7@gmail.com
#    Set "Subject" to: Portfolio Contact -- {{firstName}} {{lastName}}
#    Set "From Name" to: {{firstName}} {{lastName}}
#    Set "Reply To" to: {{email}}
#    Body: Name: {{firstName}} {{lastName}}\nEmail: {{email}}\nMessage:\n{{message}}
#    -> copy the Template ID
# 4. Go to Account -> API Keys -> copy your Public Key
#
# Add these 3 variables to your Vercel project's Environment Variables:
# Settings -> Environment Variables -> Add New

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
